<title>USA: Oregon $40 mln GO Veteran deal repriced, ylds cut.</title>
<headline>Oregon $40 mln GO Veteran deal repriced, ylds cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc. said Tuesday it repriced its Oregon $40 million Go Veteren bond deal, lowering yields in various maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>STATE OF OREGON</p>
<p>RE: $40,000,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>VETERAN'S WELFARE BONDS SERIES 76A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aa2		   S&amp;P: AA		    FITCH: AA</p>
<p>DATED: 04/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 10/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 04/01 &amp; 10/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		AMOUNT*   AMOUNT*   COUPON</p>
<p>			   (4/1)    (10/1)</p>
<p>1999		     285M	295M    4.40  %</p>
<p>2000		     300M	305M    4.60  %</p>
<p>2001		     315M	320M    4.70  %</p>
<p>2002		     325M	335M    4.80  %</p>
<p>2003		     340M	350M    4.90  %</p>
<p>2004		     360M	365M    5.00  %</p>
<p>2005		     375M	385M    5.10  %</p>
<p>2006		     390M	405M    5.20  %</p>
<p>2007		     410M	425M    5.30  %</p>
<p>2008		     435M	440M    5.45  %</p>
<p>2009		     460M	465M    5.55  %</p>
<p>2010		     480M	495M    5.60  %</p>
<p>2011		     505M	520M    5.65  %</p>
<p>2017			--     7,490M    5.90  %</p>
<p>2028			--    22,425M    6.05  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 04/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 04/01/2009</p>
<p>PLEASE REFER TO PAGES 5-6 FOR SINKING FUND REDEMPTIONS AND SPECIAL REDEMPTIONS.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, April 9, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on April 24, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>U.S. National Bank of Oregon</p>
